ss=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">400,000 - 800,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20120622191426&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Music_Box_5f0c53.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a music box.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It may have some charming effects when played to certain creatures, but disappears in the process.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<ul><li>It is a reward of the <a href=\"#/quest/realm-of-dreams-quest\">Realm of Dreams Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>It can be used to tame a few creatures with a 100% success rate, including: <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonling\">Dragonling</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Draptor\">Draptor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Enraged%20White%20Deer\">Enraged White Deer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ironblight\">Ironblight</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Magma%20Crawler\">Magma Crawler</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Panther\">Midnight Panther</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\">Wailing Widow</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Horse\">Wild Horse</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Panda\">Panda</a>.</li>\n<li>NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Lothar\">Lothar</a> responds to <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">music box</span>: <div class=\"NPCQuote messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"npc\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lothar\">Lothar</a></span>: <span class=\"msg\">Where did you get that? What a rare treat. This must have been crafted by someone who truly loves both music and animals. I can't tell you anything else about it.</span><br/><span style=\"padding: 0 1em; font-size: 90%; line-height: 90%; font-style: italic;\">Read more...</span></div><br/></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Chequered Teddy</li><li>Dragon Mimicry</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonling\">Dragonling</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonling%20%28Mount%29\">Dragonling (Mount)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Draptor\">Draptor</a></li><li>Draptor (Mount)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enraged%20White%20Deer\">Enraged White Deer</a></li><li>Friend of Elves</li><li>Guide:Mounts</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ironblight\">Ironblight</a></li><li>Ironblight (Mount)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kingly%20Deer\">Kingly Deer</a></li><li>Lucky Horseshoe</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magma%20Crawler\">Magma Crawler</a></li><li>Magma Crawler (Mount)</li><li>Magnetised</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Midnight%20Panther\">Midnight Panther</a></li><li>Midnight Panther (Mount)</li><li>Music Box (TibiaSpace)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Jaguar\">Mystic Jaguar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Panda\">Panda</a></li><li>Quests</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/realm-of-dreams-quest\">Realm of Dreams Quest</a></li><li>Scales and Tail</li><li>Spin-Off</li><li>Starless Night</li><li>Tamed Panda</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%27s%2015th%20Anniversary\">Tibia's 15th Anniversary</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\">Wailing Widow</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Horse\">War Horse</a></li><li>Way to Hell</li><li>Widow Queen</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Horse\">Wild Horse</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["realm-of-dreams-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"realm-of-dreams-quest","quest":"Realm of Dreams Quest","kind":"reward"}]}}